# Build outputs — rebuilt inside Docker
**/target/

# Angular build cache and installed packages — frontend-maven-plugin re-downloads Node
# and re-runs npm install during the Docker build
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

# Git and IDE
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Elastic Beanstalk config (not needed inside image)
.elasticbeanstalk/
Dockerrun.aws.json

# Keep source and config files, exclude markdown
*.md
README.txt
